                                <span class="text-muted">120 Đánh giá</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex-grow-1">
                                <!-- Progress bars mock -->
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1"><span class="text-muted" style="width: 25px;">5★</span><div class="progress flex-grow-1" style="height: 8px;"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width: 85%"></div></div></div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1"><span class="text-muted" style="width: 25px;">4★</span><div class="progress flex-grow-1" style="height: 8px;"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width: 10%"></div></div></div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1"><span class="text-muted" style="width: 25px;">3★</span><div class="progress flex-grow-1" style="height: 8px;"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width: 3%"></div></div></div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1"><span class="text-muted" style="width: 25px;">2★</span><div class="progress flex-grow-1" style="height: 8px;"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width: 1%"></div></div></div>
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1"><span class="text-muted" style="width: 25px;">1★</span><div class="progress flex-grow-1" style="height: 8px;"><div class="progress-bar bg-warning" style="width: 1%"></div></div></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row g-4">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="review-card shadow-sm">
                                    <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                                        <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=1" class="avatar">
                                        <div>
                                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Trần Minh Tuấn</h6>
                                            <small class="text-muted">12/05/2026</small>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="ms-auto text-warning">★★★★★</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">Tour tuyệt vời! Hướng dẫn viên rất nhiệt tình và chuyên nghiệp. Đồ ăn trên du thuyền cực kỳ ngon. Sẽ ủng hộ lần sau!</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <div class="review-card shadow-sm">
                                    <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                                        <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=5" class="avatar">
                                        <div>
                                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Nguyễn Ngọc Ánh</h6>
                                            <small class="text-muted">05/04/2026</small>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="ms-auto text-warning">★★★★★</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-muted mb-0">Lịch trình hợp lý, không quá mệt mỏi. Phòng ốc sạch sẽ chuẩn 5 sao. Gia đình mình đã có một kỳ nghỉ thật tuyệt vời.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <!-- SIDEBAR (RIGHT) -->
            <div class="col-lg-4">
                <div class="booking-sidebar">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-danger px-2 py-1"><i class="bi bi-percent"></i> Tiết kiệm tới 15%</span>
                        <span class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-eye"></i> 45 người đang xem</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p class="text-muted mb-1">Giá từ</p>
                    <div class="price-display mb-1">@Model.Schedule.ActualAdultPrice.ToString("N0") <span class="fs-4 text-dark fw-bold">VND</span></div>
                    <p class="text-muted fs-6 mb-4">/ Người lớn</p>

                    <div class="bg-light rounded-3 p-3 mb-4">
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-bottom pb-2 mb-2">
                            <span class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-calendar-event me-2"></i>Khởi hành</span>
                            <strong class="text-dark">@Model.Schedule.StartDate.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between pb-2 mb-2 border-bottom">
                            <span class="text-muted"><i class="bi bi-clock me-2"></i>Thời gian</span>
                            <strong class="text-dark">@Model.Schedule.Tour.Days Ngày</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between">
